`copy()` helper:
```ts
async function copy(label: string, value: string): Promise<void> {
  const ok = await copyText(value);
  if (!ok) { toastError('Could not copy', `Select the ${label} and copy it manually.`); return; }
  addToast({ kind: 'success', title: `${label} copied`, message: value });
}
```
Maybe don't include secret in toast for password. For password, use generic message. We can pass `secret = false`.
