```ts
const value = secrets[link.id];
if (!value) return;
const ok = await copyText(value);
if (!ok) toastError(...); else addToast({kind:'success', title:'Password copied', message:'Use it in the site environment or your client.'});
```
Avoid logging secret in toast. Good.

