catch { revealError = {...revealError, [link.id]: describeError(caught).message}; }
finally { ... }
```
`hide(link)`: remove secret.
`onhide` should set revealed false; SecretField's `revealed={Boolean(secrets[link.id])}`. If value is empty string? secret value non-empty. Fine.

